# a plaque outline with a window cut out of it, for `extrude`: the hole becomes
# a real tunnel through the slab (its own inward-facing wall), not a painted-over
# rectangle - the same outline a shape collider would use.
version 1
fill 1 1 1 1
contour 4
v -0.8 -0.5
v 0.8 -0.5
v 0.8 0.5
v -0.8 0.5
hole 4
v -0.3 -0.2
v -0.3 0.2
v 0.3 0.2
v 0.3 -0.2
